# AI Model Policy — Lasam Urban Hazard Planning

Use **Composer 2.5 Fast** (`composer-2.5-fast`) for all AI-assisted work on this repository:

- Feature implementation and bug fixes
- Documentation updates
- Code review and refactoring
- Agent task delegation

When launching subagents or parallel tasks, specify `composer-2.5-fast` as the model unless the user explicitly requests a different model.

## Project Context

- Frontend-only hazard simulation prototype for Lasam, Cagayan LGU
- No backend, auth, or scientific hazard modeling in v1
- MapLibre + React + Turf.js stack
- All results must show demonstration disclaimers

## Conventions

- Match existing component patterns in `src/components/`
- Keep simulation logic in `src/lib/simulation/`
- Sample data in `public/data/`
- Minimize scope; avoid over-engineering
